window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I've lost so much.</b><br> <br> <b>I don't plan on losing anymore.</b><br> <br> Arcadia welcomes its new queen and I am determined to do the best for my people. With my mates by my side helping me along the way the future seems brighter.<br> <br> So much hangs in the balance. I want to honor my father's wishes and unite us all but, darkness in the form of the Fae queen looms on the horizon. I won't be caught off guard, when she strikes, I will be ready. She won't get away with all the pain and destruction she's caused. This fight won't be easy, but I won't be doing it alone.<br> <br> Truths will be revealed, new alliances will be formed and forged as we fight to secure the freedom of our realms.<br> <br> <b>War is coming . . . and I am bringing my Vengeance and Fire with it.</b></p>"; 
